  "description": "WebAssembly-specific extensions for Blazouter routing library. This package provides optimized components and integration for Blazor WebAssembly applications with client-side routing enhancements. Enables React Router-like routing features in Blazor WASM with full support for nested routes, guards, lazy loading, smooth transitions, and browser-based navigation. Optimized for reduced bundle size and fast client-side performance.",
